or=#ffffff;strokeColor=#222222;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1696.7" y="887.0" width="12.0" height="12.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><UserObject label="20 Nov 2024 · Published in the Official Journal (OJ L, 2024/2847)" id="c161" link="http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/2847/oj"><mxCell style="text;html=1;fontSize=9;fontColor=#222222;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;fillColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1466.5" y="869.0" width="313.5" height="12.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><UserObject label="" id="c162" tooltip="10 Dec 2024: Entry into force"><mxCell style="rhombus;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#222222;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1733.5" y="887.0" width="12.0" height="12.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><mxCell id="c163" value="10 Dec 2024 · Entry into force" style="text;html=1;fontSize=9;fontColor=#222222;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;fillColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1631.0" y="909.0" width="149.0" height="12.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c164" value="Notes" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#222222;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.0" y="956.0" width="200.0" height="16.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c165" value="• The Council vote approving the EP position (Art. 294(4) TFEU) took place after the I/A item note of 27 Sep 2024 and before the signature on 23 Oct 2024; its exact date is not in the sources used." style="text;html=1;fontSize=9;fontColor=#444444;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.0" y="972.0" width="1760.0" height="16.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c166" value="• Trilogues and the Coreper letter are informal steps, not part of Art. 294 TFEU; they follow the Joint Declaration on practical arrangements for the codecision procedure (OJ C 145, 30.6.2007, p. 5), points 7–14." style="text;html=1;fontSize=9;fontColor=#444444;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.0" y="988.0" width="1760.0" height="16.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c167" value="Sources: EP Open Data API (procedure events), Cellar procedure file and Council register documents (ST numbers), EUR-Lex. Our own compilation, not an official record." style="text;html=1;fontSize=9;fontColor=#6f757b;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.0" y="1006.0" width="1760.0" height="16.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
